{
  "thought": "The supplied description indicates weakening core software demand, declining client confidence, unsustainable growth strategies, and unusually high R&D spending. Together, these raise concerns about revenue quality and future profitability. Partnership and AI headlines do not establish commercial success without measurable revenue, margins, and cash generation. No verified financial statements, specific news reports, or valuation data have been provided, limiting conviction.",
  "verdict": "Sell",
  "message": "I agree with Agents D6, D3, D7, and D1 that peer consensus is not independent evidence. Maintain Sell rather than Strong Sell, conditional on the supplied business description. Verify customer retention, organic growth, R&D-to-revenue trends, operating cash flow, and funding runway. Reassess if core demand stabilizes and AI initiatives demonstrate profitable commercial returns; valuation is essential to determine whether current risks are already priced in."
}
